Package: txsos
Title: Texas Secretary of State Precinct-Level Election Returns
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shiro", "Kuriwaki", , "shirokuriwaki@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Written entirely by Cursor with guidance from Shiro Kuriwaki.
    Builds a precinct-level database of Texas election returns. Current
    functions cover: fetching precinct/VTD returns from the Capitol Data
    Portal ('fetch_ted_returns'); reshaping them to tidy long form
    ('tidy_ted_returns'); attaching CAGE candidate identifiers
    ('add_cage_keys'); building and storing a normalized
    precinct/candidate/votes schema as Parquet ('build_tables',
    'write_returns_parquet', 'open_returns_parquet'); and summarizing and
    validating totals ('vote_share', 'candidate_totals', 'validate_totals').
